Comment: The per-file attribution that used to stand here named files the
 packaging no longer has: the rename to matomo-vanilla moved debian/postinst,
 debian/templates and their siblings to matomo-vanilla.* names, and others --
 debian/piwik.cron.d, debian/docs, debian/install, debian/substvars -- are gone
 altogether. Rather than keep stanzas pointing at nothing, the three authors of
 the packaging are credited together for all of it; none of their earlier work
 has been removed from the history.

On Debian systems, you can find the full text of the GNU General Public
